WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
You lead the main force of the Forbidden Army to confront the enemy on the right and attract them to attack.

2
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:07,220
Then who will attack me?

3
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,640
I led the right holy army to outflank him from behind.

4
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,790
Attacking from two sides, it is possible to achieve success with one fell swoop

5
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:15,590
It’s really Liao Di’s first wife

6
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:17,790
As expected of the Queen Mother’s confidant

7
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:20,790
Attack forward and attack the enemy in one fell swoop

8
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:36,750
Xuan case Ye Xuan

9
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,550
When will you come?

10
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:48,400
Where is Ye Xuan? Where is Ye Xuan of the Right Holy Army?

11
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,560
shameless person

12
00:00:53,560 --> 00:01:02,390
General Zhou, you also want to rebel

13
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:05,460
This general is ordered by the King of Qin. What is rebellion?

14
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:08,460
I came here today with only an old debt

15
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:09,460
Ask for it from you

16
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:12,460
Wang Teng, do you still remember what Guan Kou did back then?

17
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:15,460
General Fei led three thousand Yanling Guards to attack thousands of miles away

18
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:17,460
The fox-slaying commander killed countless enemies

19
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:20,460
You don’t get much credit, but it’s written that you fought bloody battles without retreating and contained the enemy’s main force.

20
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:22,460
Later, the Queen Mother wanted to get rid of the non-general

21
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:24,460
It was you who gave Zen speeches in the court hall

22
00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:26,460
It is said that unless a general attacks the master of the high formation, sooner or later he will counterattack

23
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:29,460
The Queen Mother drank a glass of poisoned wine, and General Fei died in the capital.

24
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:31,460
Our border army was disbanded

25
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:32,460
No confession, no accommodation

26
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:35,460
How many people have fallen into poverty and how many people have turned into bandits?
